      "description": "Navy tab bar with white active underline and yellow pending counts.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-tabs\"><button class=\"ds-tab is-active\">总览</button><button class=\"ds-tab\">待审批 <span class=\"ds-count\">2</span></button><button class=\"ds-tab\">加额流水</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;background:#0e2a52;padding:0 16px}.ds-tab{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 14px 12px;border:0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;background:none;color:#c3d1e6;font:14px \"PingFang SC\",system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:color .15s,border-color .15s}.ds-tab:hover{color:#fff}.ds-tab.is-active{color:#fff;border-bottom-color:#fff;font-weight:600}.ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #fff;outline-offset:-4px}.ds-count{min-width:20px;padding:0 6px;border-radius:2px;background:#f2b705;color:#1b1600;font:600 12px/18px \"Fira Sans Condensed\",sans-serif;text-align:center}"
