      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Fixed-ramp gauge: empty at 0, full at threshold + amount, ink tick at threshold.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-gauges\"><span class=\"ds-gauge\"><span class=\"ds-fill\" style=\"width:61%\"></span><span class=\"ds-tick\" style=\"left:50%\"></span></span><span class=\"ds-gauge is-low\"><span class=\"ds-fill\" style=\"width:15%\"></span><span class=\"ds-tick\" style=\"left:37%\"></span></span><span class=\"ds-gauge is-blocked\"><span class=\"ds-fill\" style=\"width:2%\"></span><span class=\"ds-tick\" style=\"left:9%\"></span></span><span class=\"ds-gauge is-empty\"><span class=\"ds-tick\" style=\"left:20%\"></span></span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-gauges{display:grid;gap:16px;width:240px}.ds-gauge{position:relative;display:block;height:8px;background:#e8ecf2}.ds-fill{position:absolute;inset:0 auto 0 0;background:#0e2a52;transition:width .3s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-tick{position:absolute;top:-4px;bottom:-4px;width:2px;margin-left:-1px;background:#13203a}.is-low .ds-fill{background:#d08a0c}.is-blocked .ds-fill{background:#d93a3f}.ds-gauge.is-empty{background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#e8ecf2 0 6px,transparent 6px 10px)}"
